      url: "/portraits/florentino-ameghino-unknown-1910.jpg",
      source: "Photographic portrait of Florentino Ameghino captioned 'Portrait of Florentino Ameghino, October, 1910. Courtesy of W. J. Sinclair', printed as Fig. 1 of William Diller Matthew's obituary in Popular Science Monthly, volume 80, March 1912, New York. The photographer is unknown. The file is a plain downscale of the 1501 x 1864 pixel scan of that printed figure (a halftone in an oval frame) from Wikimedia Commons, reduced to 966 x 1200 pixels with no upscaling and no cropping. Identity rests on the printed caption and the article about him.",
